WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:04,140
You are not what I thought, are you?

2
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:09,330
Yes, Sister Meng

3
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:10,850
I'm missing a kidney

4
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:12,530
Later, my health got worse

5
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:13,930
It hurts if you walk fast

6
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,690
Where are your kidneys?

7
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:23,460
Donate it. I didn’t know it was a kidney.

8
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:24,980
is part of your body

9
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:30,510
How can you speak so calmly? I know Sister Meng.

10
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:33,620
Please keep this matter a secret for me

11
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:38,690
Okay, since one kidney is missing

12
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:40,370
You want to join the public relations department?

13
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:43,230
The public relations department must know how to drink

14
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,500
Even if you can't drink

15
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:48,020
Even those who are in trouble need to have a drink or two

16
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,660
I'll go talk to Mr. Shen

17
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,020
Your situation prevents you from entering the public relations department.

18
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:51,940
Sister Meng, don’t go

19
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,460
Mr. Shen, he may not know
